<section class="section problem" id="problem">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div class="eyebrow" data-i18n="prob.eyebrow">The Problem</div>
      <h2 class="section-title" data-i18n="prob.title">Two pressures, one window of opportunity.</h2>
    </div>

    <div class="prob-grid">
      <article class="prob-card prob-physical">
        <div class="prob-icon">体</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="prob.card1.title">Physical decline begins quietly</h3>
        <p data-i18n="prob.card1.body">
          The 45–64 age group is at a stage where bodily functions
          gradually decline — slowed metabolism, reduced muscle strength,
          changes in cardiovascular function.
        </p>
        <p class="prob-quote" data-i18n="prob.card1.quote">
          Without active prevention, these changes accumulate and lead to
          chronic disease, disability and greater medical demand.
        </p>
        <span class="prob-cite" data-i18n="prob.card1.cite">Report of Population Health Survey 2020–22</span>
      </article>

      <article class="prob-card prob-psych">
        <div class="prob-icon prob-icon--gold">心</div>
        <h3 data-i18n="prob.card2.title">Health awareness turns to anxiety</h3>
        <p data-i18n="prob.card2.body">
          When physical condition deteriorates, middle-aged individuals
          often develop stronger health awareness than younger years —
          but this heightened perception can trigger health anxiety and
          excessive worry about underlying disease.
        </p>
        <p class="prob-quote" data-i18n="prob.card2.quote">
          The rise in health consciousness creates an opportunity for
          effective intervention — through empathetic psychological support
          and lifestyle adjustments rooted in long-term care.
        </p>
        <span class="prob-cite" data-i18n="prob.card2.cite">Godino et al., 2014 · Alsenany 2025</span>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .problem { padding-top: 56px; padding-bottom: 80px; }
  .section-head { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto 56px; text-align: center; }
  .section-head .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 16px; }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .prob-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 28px;
  }
  .prob-card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);
    border: 1.18px solid var(--hairline);
    border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
    padding: 40px 36px;
    box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(107, 93, 79, 0.08);
    backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
  }
  .prob-icon {
    width: 56px;
    height: 56px;
    border-radius: 16px;
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--shiqing) 0%, #5d6f57 100%);
    color: #fff;
    font-family: var(--font-brush);
    font-size: 32px;
    text-align: center;
    line-height: 56px;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(123, 140, 118, 0.32);
  }
  .prob-icon--gold {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--gold) 0%, var(--gold-bright) 100%);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(212, 165, 116, 0.38);
  }
  .prob-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--ink);
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .prob-card p {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .prob-quote {
    padding-left: 14px;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--shiqing);
    color: var(--ink-soft) !important;
    font-style: normal;
  }
  .prob-psych .prob-quote { border-left-color: var(--gold); }
  .prob-cite {
    display: block;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--ink-muted);
    opacity: 0.7;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .prob-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .section-title { font-size: 28px; }
    .prob-card { padding: 28px 24px; }
  }
</style>
